		(property "Note" "U4 EN pull-down: TPS2553 off while GPIO46 is high-Z (RP2350 reset state: output Hi-Z, pulled low, DS 9.3). 4.7k (<= 8.2k) so a GPIO turned from driven-high to input with IE set cannot hold the pad at ~2.2 V (RP2350-E9, DS D.5.1; logic review L-10 2026-10-27; was 100k); 0.7 mA while EN is driven high. Fixed ref R80 = after the last auto-numbered resistor (R79), so the routed board's refs do not shift"
